From: josepiresrocha-source <josepiresrocha-source@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:41:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] launcher: AYN Thor edition (Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 / Adreno
 740)

Based on 0066e7f, the launcher of the public v0.1 APK.

- Own application id (com.daedalus.tlou.remastered.thor), so it installs
  beside the original APK, which is signed with a key only its author has.
- Bundled Turnip Thor driver (drivers/turnip-thor-a740.zip + .sha256,
  staged by CI) selected by default on Adreno 740; the stock Turnip R1
  stays installed and selectable.
- Mesa shader disk cache: MESA_SHADER_CACHE_DIR in the app cache and
  MESA_SHADER_CACHE_DISABLE=false. The game is a separate executable, so
  Mesa cannot find an app cache directory itself and keeps the cache off.
- TLOU_FAST_RENDER_CORES=1 on SM8550: the runtime's existing policy keeps
  the four critical render threads off the three Cortex-A510 cores.
- 30 FPS limit by default on SM8550 (fresh installs only).
- "AYN THOR" settings card: recommended profile, shader cache and core
  switches, clear cache, and extra environment lines (validated, applied
  last, logged) for driver A/B tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
